# Malevolent Chandelier (6, 4/4 flying): "{2}: Put target card from a graveyard on the bottom of its owner's library. Activate
# only as a sorcery." (CR 602.5d, 401.4). Turn 1 Black Lotus and three Moxen pay {6} (the pool empty right after); two more Moxen
# stay untapped. Bot2's turn 2 Lightning Bolt is on the stack, so the Chandelier's ability is refused at instant speed even
# with {2} available. On turn 3, paid with exactly two Moxen, it puts Bot2's Bolt on the bottom of Bot2's library, and (paid
# with two more) Bot1's own Black Lotus on the bottom of Bot1's library - each owner's, one just outside the filter (a
# permanent, the Mox Jet) refused.

